WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.920
Caller: Hi, I know you're closed. Can I still book a bike assessment?

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.860
AI receptionist: Yes, I can help. Is it a repair or a general check?

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:11.340
Caller: My brakes are squeaking. I'd like someone to take a look.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.510
AI receptionist: Got it. I can offer Thursday at eleven, or Friday at two.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:20.890
Caller: Thursday at eleven could work... Oh, hang on, sorry, could we do Friday at two instead?

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:25.170
AI receptionist: Yeah, of course. Friday at two. What name should I put it under?

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.710
Caller: Alex Morgan. The number I'm calling from is fine for confirmation.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:35.750
AI receptionist: Your Friday two o'clock assessment is in the diary. I'll send the confirmation and share the details with the team.

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:37.550
Caller: Brilliant, thank you.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:39.990
AI receptionist: You're welcome, Alex. See you Friday.
